              "text": "1 players use the table arrangement described for Following."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Lay out Following according to its patience tableau, reserve, stock, or foundation structure before beginning play."
